extends ui_layout

block styles
  link(type='text/css', rel='stylesheet', href='/public/css/com.css')

block content
  .sixteen.wide.column.centered#com
    .ui.card
      .com-header
        h1 FreshView Community Guidelines
      .com-content
        p Congratulations on creating your profile, fresher! 👋 Here are some tips before diving into the community.
        p <strong style="color: black;">FreshView</strong> is built on two simple ideas: authentic sharing and honest feedback. People come here to share real moments from everyday life—photos, questions, opinions—and to get honest perspectives from others.
        h2 Help Keep FreshView Kind
        p Our moderators can't be everywhere — that's where you come in. If you spot something in the following list, <strong>Flag It 🚩</strong> so we can investigate, or <strong>respond with care</strong>. A little thoughtfulness goes a long way.
        h3.left-align No Personal Attacks and Bullying
        p Zero tolerance on attacking or harassing others based on their identity, appearance, gender, or personal expressions! FreshView is a place for authentic sharing, not to tear each other down.
        h3.left-align No Racism, sexism, and other discrimination
        p Attacking entire classes of people is just like attacking a single person: we'll ban you for it.
        h3.left-align No NSFW material
        p If you wouldn't show your boss, don't show it here!
        p We appreciate your efforts in helping shape the tone of the platform. 
        h2 Refer Back to the Guidelines Anytime
        p After entering the main feed, you can always refer back to the community guidelines in the menu on the top right corner.
        p See you soon, Fresher! 🎉
        .com-footer
          .com-footer-content
            img.com-logo(src='/public/favicon.svg', alt='<strong style="color: black;">FreshView</strong> Logo')
            if !fromFeed
              .com-enter
                .ui.large.primary.button.enter Enter

  script.
    $('.ui.large.primary.button.enter').on('click', function() {
      $.post('/account/consent', { _csrf: $('meta[name="csrf-token"]').attr('content') })
        .done(function(json) {
          if (json["result"] === "success") {
            window.location.href = !{JSON.stringify((user.experimentalCondition === 'C1' || user.experimentalCondition === 'C4') ? '/training_intro' : (user.experimentalCondition === 'C2' ? '/beta_intro' : '/'))};
          }
        })
        .fail(function() {
          alert('Error setting consent. Please try again.');
        });
    });
